      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI yayaasia Amahanga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba lole, mundaalo etsio, kata khushise eshio. Olwa ndalakalusia tsikhabi tsiaYuda naYerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndalakhung'aasia amahanga kosi, ningakholomosia ningayila mwibanda liaYehoshafati; ne ndaleenesana ninako ebweneyo khulwa abandu banje khandi khulwa obulaame bwanje Isiraeli, okhuba babasalaasiye mumahanga, nibakabana eshialo shianje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakhupila abandu banje ikha, nibarunga omusiani khulwa omutamba, nibakulaasia omukhaana idivai nibanywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubeele murie ninasi, inywe Tiro naSidoni netsimbali tsiosi tsiebuFilisiti? Mwenya okhurunga elia ndakhola noho? Ne nimuba nimurunga, nonoho ndalakalusia omurungo kweenywe khwinywe abeene, habwene nahnbwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba mwabukula tsifeetsa tsianje netsitsahaabu tsianje, nimuyila ebindu bianje ebilayi ebiolukoosi muhekalu tsieenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakusiye abaYuda nabaYerusalemu khubaYunani, mbu mubarusie batsie ehale okhurula khunzakho tsiabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano endi okhubayakulila habundu tsana ewa mwabakusilia, barulemwo; ne ndalakalusia omurungo kweenywe khwinywe abeene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana beenywe abasiani nabakhaana, ndalabakusia mumakhono kabaana baYuda, nabo balabakusia khubandu baSeba, khwihanga elili ehale; okhuba OMWAMI niye ouboolile",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obuhonibzui bwaYuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
